### 1.2 Data Dictionary

**Users**
- user_id (UUID, PK)
- email (String)
- created_at (Timestamp)

**Local_Nodes**
- node_id (UUID, PK)
- user_id (FK -> Users.user_id)
- device_name (String)
- status (Enum: ONLINE, OFFLINE)
- last_heartbeat (Timestamp)

**Agents**
- agent_id (UUID, PK)
- user_id (FK -> Users.user_id)
- name (String) - e.g., "ShoppingAssistant_01"
- type (String) - e.g., "Python_Script", "AutoGPT"

**Delegation_Sessions**
- session_id (UUID, PK)
- user_id (FK -> Users.user_id)
- agent_id (FK -> Agents.agent_id) — authorized agent for this session
- node_id (FK -> Local_Nodes.node_id)
- policy_hash (String) — ensures tamper detection of policy
- policy_version (Integer)
- max_total_spend (BigInt, atomic units)
- max_per_tx (BigInt, atomic units)
- allowed_domains (JSON array)
- allowed_recipients (JSON array)
- rate_limit (Integer, e.g. per minute)
- ttl_seconds (Integer)
- expires_at (Timestamp)
- last_counter (BigInt) — prevents replay; monotonic counter for request ordering
- revoked_at (Timestamp, nullable)
- revoked_reason (String, nullable)
- client_fingerprint (String)
- created_at (Timestamp)

**Transaction_Logs**
- tx_id (UUID, PK)
- session_id (FK -> Delegation_Sessions.session_id)
- operation (String) — e.g. "x402_pay"
- amount (String)
- recipient (String)
- domain (String)
- decision (Enum: APPROVED, DENIED)
- deny_code (String, nullable) — reason code when DENIED
- counter (BigInt)
- idempotency_key (String)
- http_402_proof_hash (String) — hash of 402 challenge for audit
- tx_hash (String, nullable)
- created_at (Timestamp)

*Supports audit and dispute investigation.*

**Local_API_Requests**
- request_id (UUID, PK)
- session_id (FK -> Delegation_Sessions.session_id)
- operation (String)
- params_hash (String)
- auth_valid (Boolean)
- counter (BigInt)
- ip (String)
- created_at (Timestamp)

*Useful for forensic analysis.*

