## 4. MVP Security Checklist

Implement first:

| # | Requirement | Notes |
|---|-------------|--------|
| 1 | **Loopback-only API** | Bind to 127.0.0.1 only; block external access via OS firewall. |
| 2 | **Shared-secret auth** | HMAC signature using secret stored in OS keychain; reject invalid. |
| 3 | **Opaque session handle** | Agent receives only session_handle; full policy stays in Local Portal. |
| 4 | **TTL + inactivity timeout** | Sessions expire on TTL or inactivity; enforce in Delegation_Sessions. |
| 5 | **Allowlist domains** | allowed_domains on session; reject requests for domains not in list. |
| 6 | **Per-tx + rate limit** | Enforce max_per_tx and rate_limit_per_min before executing. |
| 7 | **Replay protection** | counter + idempotency_key; last_counter on session; deny duplicates. |
| 8 | **Keychain storage** | CDP refresh token and session secrets in macOS Keychain / Windows Credential Vault. |